WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.530 --> 00:00:07.670
For the thrill of chasing a high score,

00:00:07.690 --> 00:00:11.070
for all the great heroes who captured our imaginations,

00:00:11.070 --> 00:00:13.550
and the villains we like more than the heroes.  

00:00:13.550 --> 00:00:18.730
Waiting 20 years for it and finally getting a good batman game.

00:00:18.730 --> 00:00:22.470
For the games that have no end, that we still try to finish.

00:00:22.470 --> 00:00:25.860
and the self-imposed challenges when the game wasn't hard enough.

00:00:25.860 --> 00:00:29.430
and when it still isn't hard enough, we face the best online.

00:00:29.540 --> 00:00:33.350
For the in your face scares, and all the times

00:00:33.350 --> 00:00:35.850
you're afraid to trek into the darkness. 

00:00:35.850 --> 00:00:41.370
All those grueling hours spent getting rare items, and all the grueling hours finding obscure games.

00:00:41.370 --> 00:00:46.720
For the countless times we save the princess, only to find she was in another castle.

00:00:46.740 --> 00:00:50.290
For the power of the Tri Force... which we'll never really understand.

00:00:50.290 --> 00:00:52.970
For the fun of beating our friends with cheap moves,

00:00:52.970 --> 00:00:55.560
 but then agreeing to go two out of three.

00:00:55.560 --> 00:00:58.140
For all the secret moves we show off,

00:00:58.300 --> 00:01:01.100
for the sound of those clicking buttons,

00:01:01.100 --> 00:01:03.900
and for the satisfaction we get when we

00:01:03.900 --> 00:01:07.500
finally realize the solution was right in front of our face the whole time.

00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:10.620
For the Konomi code, for late nights with old friends,

00:01:10.620 --> 00:01:13.120
and the really late nights with new friends. 

00:01:13.120 --> 00:01:16.510
For the E3 press conferences for just a small glimpse of the future.

00:01:16.550 --> 00:01:20.790
For the cool gadgets that are still awesome even though they don't work right...

00:01:20.790 --> 00:01:24.710
For the greats, and the years they dedicated to our entertainment.

00:01:24.710 --> 00:01:28.630
For the badasses, and for the characters who define generations.

00:01:28.630 --> 00:01:31.310
For the old tech and the new...

00:01:31.310 --> 00:01:35.050
and for all the great things that could never fit into one video.

00:01:35.050 --> 00:01:38.080
This is why we love video games.

00:01:44.500 --> 00:01:46.290
game over

